{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>El eretz gezerah.</b> Different from ordinary lands — a model of 'cut off from the land of the living'; a place separated and distanced from people, so that if it carries him to a land fit for sowing, it will no longer produce growth." "<b>And send the goat in the wilderness.</b> A model of 'and send the live bird over the face of the field.'"], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:54.189727928Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}